msgid "Cropped, marks from the rest of the sheet painted out, resized"
msgstr "Zugeschnitten, Spuren vom Rest des Blatts entfernt, Größe geändert"

#: archive
#. What was done to an archive picture or film before it was put on the site.
msgctxt "changes.5"
msgid "Cropped, resized"
msgstr "Zugeschnitten, Größe geändert"

#: archive
#. What was done to an archive picture or film before it was put on the site.
msgctxt "changes.6"
msgid "Cropped, turned upright, resized"
msgstr "Zugeschnitten, aufrecht gedreht, Größe geändert"

#: archive
#. What was done to an archive picture or film before it was put on the site.
